Third-party-derived runtime logic
=================================

The Bash dialect framing in `src/tfbash_mcp/runtime/bash.py` is adapted from
`PexpectTerminalEnv` in A2C-SMCP/ide4ai at commit
20ece038e66e13885e77503e217b23766e60dc86. The source file identifies its
original author as JQQ <jqq1716@gmail.com>. At that commit, ide4ai's
`pyproject.toml` declares the project under the MIT License, although the
referenced repository tree does not contain the LICENSE file named by its
README.

Retained ideas and behavior include per-instance randomized prompt and exit
code delimiters and base64+eval wrapping for multi-line commands. The blocking
pexpect ownership and expect-loop were replaced by tfbash-mcp's incremental,
transport-independent byte protocol.

